        "original_id": "2414e1f1-18cd-5825-b839-12dfe69fc05d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Myles Kennedy, Mark Tremonti, Michael \"Elvis\" Baskette, Slash\n- Bands: Alter Bridge, Myles Kennedy and the Conspirators, SafetySuit\n- Places: Tulsa, Oklahoma, Nashville, Tennessee\n- Songs and Albums: \"Rise Today\", Blackbird\n\nFacts:\n- Myles Kennedy was born as Myles Richard Bass on November 27, 1969.\n- Myles Kennedy is an American musician, singer, and songwriter.\n- Myles Kennedy is the lead vocalist and rhythm guitarist of Alter Bridge.\n- Myles Kennedy is also the lead vocalist in Slash's backing band, Myles Kennedy and the Conspirators.\n- SafetySuit is an American pop rock and alternative rock band from Tulsa, Oklahoma.\n- SafetySuit is currently based in Nashville, Tennessee.\n- \"Rise Today\" was written by Alter Bridge lead guitarist Mark Tremonti and lead vocalist Myles Kennedy.\n- \"Rise Today\" was produced by Michael \"Elvis\" Baskette.\n- \"Rise Today\" was featured on Alter Bridge's 2007 second studio album Blackbird.",
